WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.633 --> 00:00:07.000
All right, Hawlucha, Flying Press.

2
00:00:09.733 --> 00:00:10.833
Cha!

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:14.933
Shelgon.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:17.666
Shelgon is unable to battle.

5
00:00:17.733 --> 00:00:20.200
- Hawlucha wins.
- Okay, that's one.

6
00:00:21.833 --> 00:00:22.733
Lucha.

7
00:00:23.166 --> 00:00:24.600
Okay, Shelgon, return.

8
00:00:25.866 --> 00:00:27.566
There's no doubt you're strong, Ash,

9
00:00:27.866 --> 00:00:29.433
but I'm gonna win the next one.

10
00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:31.600
Yeah, go for it, Sawyer.

11
00:00:32.766 --> 00:00:34.433
On their way to Snowbelle City,

12
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:38.166
our heroes have suddenly crossed paths with their old friend Sawyer,

13
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:42.266
which resulted in an exciting best-of-three Pokémon battle.

14
00:00:43.866 --> 00:00:45.566
All right, Honedge, let's go.

15
00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:50.933
- A new Pokémon.
- Yay!

16
00:00:51.566 --> 00:00:53.466
So, you caught a new Pokémon, huh?

17
00:00:56.433 --> 00:00:58.366
Honedge. The Sword Pokémon.

18
00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:01.533
It is said that Honedge is actually a spirit

19
00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:02.933
living inside a sword.

20
00:01:03.366 --> 00:01:05.933
- Okay, buddy, let's do it.
- Pikcachu!

21
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.466
Right, here we go.

22
00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:08.866
Fury Cutter.

23
00:01:12.733 --> 00:01:14.266
Pikachu, Iron Tail.

24
00:01:14.833 --> 00:01:17.266
Pika, pika! Pika!

25
00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:19.300
Now, Pikachu, use Thunderbolt.

26
00:01:19.766 --> 00:01:23.000
Pikachu!

27
00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:27.300
Honedge.

28
00:01:28.633 --> 00:01:30.500
Honedge is unable to battle.

29
00:01:30.933 --> 00:01:32.100
Pikachu is the winner.

30
00:01:32.166 --> 00:01:34.000
Wow. That was so amazing.

31
00:01:34.833 --> 00:01:36.000
Awesome job.

32
00:01:36.466 --> 00:01:37.500
Pika!

33
00:01:38.333 --> 00:01:40.266
Honedge, you take a good rest.

34
00:01:41.833 --> 00:01:44.500
It's frustrating but good experience.

35
00:01:45.366 --> 00:01:46.900
The third time's the charm.

36
00:01:47.333 --> 00:01:48.966
It's up to you, Sceptile.

37
00:01:51.066 --> 00:01:53.233
Sceptile!

38
00:01:53.666 --> 00:01:54.833
So, it evolved, huh?

39
00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:56.466
Check out my third Pokémon.

40
00:01:56.533 --> 00:01:58.366
Greninja. I choose you.

41
00:02:02.833 --> 00:02:03.700
Ninja.

42
00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:06.133
Gren.

43
00:02:12.233 --> 00:02:15.566
♪ I stand tall 'cause I know I'm a winner ♪

44
00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:19.333
♪ Knock me down I'll just get up again ♪

45
00:02:20.033 --> 00:02:23.200
♪ You've met your match Yeah, I'm no beginner ♪

46
00:02:23.266 --> 00:02:24.433
♪ Pokémon ♪

47
00:02:25.133 --> 00:02:26.366
♪ Pokémon ♪

48
00:02:26.433 --> 00:02:27.600
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

49
00:02:27.666 --> 00:02:30.900
♪ I stand tall 'cause I know I'm a winner ♪

50
00:02:30.966 --> 00:02:32.066
♪ Pokémon ♪

51
00:02:32.866 --> 00:02:34.066
♪ Pokémon ♪

52
00:02:34.133 --> 00:02:35.366
♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

53
00:02:47.366 --> 00:02:48.466
A Greninja.

54
00:02:49.233 --> 00:02:51.066
So, Frogadier evolved, too.

55
00:02:51.866 --> 00:02:52.733
Ah.

56
00:02:56.266 --> 00:03:00.266
Sceptile. The Forest Pokémon, and the evolved form of Grovyle.

57
00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:03.666
The seeds growing on Sceptile's back are brimming with vitamins

58
00:03:03.733 --> 00:03:05.266
that can revitalize trees.

59
00:03:05.333 --> 00:03:07.266
Here goes. Bullet Seed.

60
00:03:07.333 --> 00:03:09.166
Sceptile!

61
00:03:09.233 --> 00:03:10.366
Check this out.

62
00:03:10.733 --> 00:03:12.300
Use Water Shuriken.

63
00:03:14.966 --> 00:03:15.800
Use Cut.

64
00:03:16.233 --> 00:03:17.333
Grenin...

65
00:03:18.166 --> 00:03:19.233
Dodge it, quick.

66
00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:20.200
Ja!

67
00:03:21.533 --> 00:03:22.366
Sceptile.

68
00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:26.866
I know we've got the matchup advantage, but I've still gotta stay on my guard.

69
00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:29.100
Keep it going. With Aerial Ace.

70
00:03:30.633 --> 00:03:32.733
Sceptile, Leaf Blade.

71
00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:46.333
Huh?

72
00:03:48.133 --> 00:03:49.633
Dragon Pulse, go.

73
00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:53.766
Sceptile!

74
00:03:53.833 --> 00:03:54.866
Dodge it, quick.

75
00:03:54.933 --> 00:03:57.633
Greninja.

76
00:04:03.033 --> 00:04:05.700
- Can you go on, Greninja?
- Gren.

77
00:04:05.766 --> 00:04:08.000
Keep pushing. Leaf Storm.

78
00:04:08.066 --> 00:04:11.433
Sceptile!

79
00:04:13.166 --> 00:04:15.233
Gren... Aah!

80
00:04:15.666 --> 00:04:17.899
- Greninja.
- I'm pretty sure I've figured out

81
00:04:17.966 --> 00:04:19.433
Greninja's battling style.

82
00:04:19.733 --> 00:04:21.433
It uses speed to get up close

83
00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:23.933
so it can finish up the battle with just one attack.

84
00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:27.733
So, if I can attack from a distance, I'll have the advantage.

85
00:04:28.166 --> 00:04:29.800
He's really done his research.

86
00:04:29.866 --> 00:04:32.333
Well, Ash has become Sawyer's role model,

87
00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:34.233
so, it doesn't surprise me one bit.

88
00:04:41.733 --> 00:04:43.600
All right, Sceptile, wrap this up.

89
00:04:44.433 --> 00:04:46.166
Sceptile.

90
00:04:48.766 --> 00:04:52.333
Greninja, can you still battle? There's no doubt we can win this thing.

91
00:04:53.733 --> 00:04:56.566
Ninja!

92
00:05:03.833 --> 00:05:05.700
Huh? Hmm.

93
00:05:13.800 --> 00:05:15.100
Hey, what's going on here?

94
00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:18.633
Sceptile, I think it's time we get this over with, okay?

95
00:05:18.766 --> 00:05:19.600
Sceptile.

96
00:05:20.766 --> 00:05:22.766
Greninja, let's do this.

97
00:05:25.066 --> 00:05:26.200
Use Aerial Ace.

98
00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:30.400
Gre... nin...

99
00:05:34.366 --> 00:05:36.533
- Ja!
- Sceptile!

100
00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:37.466
Sceptile.

101
00:05:39.366 --> 00:05:41.033
Sceptile is unable to battle.

102
00:05:41.466 --> 00:05:42.366
Greninja wins.

103
00:05:42.433 --> 00:05:44.266
So, the match goes to Ash.

104
00:05:48.333 --> 00:05:50.766
Ah. Ha, ha. I still won anyway.

105
00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:54.900
No matter what I try, I can't keep up with you, Ash.

106
00:05:55.566 --> 00:05:58.266
But this battle was even more great experience.

107
00:05:58.700 --> 00:05:59.533
Hey, Ash.

108
00:05:59.866 --> 00:06:00.766
Are you okay?

109
00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:02.933
Yeah, but I'm wiped out.

110
00:06:03.666 --> 00:06:05.833
That was a close one, right, Greninja?

111
00:06:05.933 --> 00:06:06.766
Gren.

112
00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:09.466
So, Ash, you've gotta tell me what just happened.

113
00:06:09.766 --> 00:06:11.300
How did you do whatever you did?

114
00:06:11.366 --> 00:06:12.266
Fill me in.

115
00:06:12.333 --> 00:06:14.700
I don't really know what I did, Sawyer.

116
00:06:14.766 --> 00:06:17.633
Stuff just flashes in front of my eyes when I get like that.

117
00:06:17.700 --> 00:06:19.166
- Oh, I see.
- Hmm.

118
00:06:19.233 --> 00:06:20.400
Ugh, no, I don't.

119
00:06:24.066 --> 00:06:25.866
Everyone's just fine now.

120
00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:27.800
Thanks, Nurse Joy.

121
00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:29.466
Wigglytuff.

122
00:06:30.766 --> 00:06:33.066
- Pika-pi!
- Looking good, Pikachu.

123
00:06:33.133 --> 00:06:34.200
Pika-pika.

124
00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:35.966
Hey, over here.

125
00:06:36.033 --> 00:06:36.866
Okay.

126
00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:44.333
Hello there, sir, and welcome to the Pokémon Center.

127
00:06:44.733 --> 00:06:47.633
- Hi. Would you take care of this?
- Sure.

128
00:06:48.233 --> 00:06:49.233
Wigglytuff.

129
00:06:55.766 --> 00:06:57.900
Hey, your Greninja looked different in battle,

130
00:06:57.966 --> 00:06:59.533
- didn't it, Ash?
- Did it?

131
00:06:59.966 --> 00:07:01.000
It sure did.

132
00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:03.133
And it was all wrapped up in water.

133
00:07:03.566 --> 00:07:06.133
So, please, tell me how the two of you did that, okay?

134
00:07:06.633 --> 00:07:09.966
Uh, I really don't have a clue.

135
00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:11.133
Pikachu.

136
00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:13.566
Actually, none of us have any idea.

137
00:07:13.633 --> 00:07:15.000
It just happens.

138
00:07:15.066 --> 00:07:18.133
That's true, although so far it's only happened a few times.

139
00:07:18.566 --> 00:07:20.233
Wow, that's so strange.

140
00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:22.900
The way Ash and Greninja were moving together like that,

141
00:07:22.966 --> 00:07:24.600
as if they'd become one.

142
00:07:25.033 --> 00:07:27.666
It was just like that when it happened before, wasn't it?

143
00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:29.600
Well... kind of, I guess.

144
00:07:30.166 --> 00:07:31.100
Hmm.

145
00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:34.433
It's really hard to explain.

146
00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:38.433
I guess it's like all the things that Greninja's seeing and doing,

147
00:07:38.966 --> 00:07:42.066
I'm seeing and doing the exact same things at the same time.

148
00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:46.066
It sounds like you're telling us you get fused together.

149
00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:48.666
Right. Then I start to burn up.

150
00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:50.066
Like I'm on fire.

151
00:07:50.366 --> 00:07:52.466
After that, I wanna go to sleep.

152
00:07:53.233 --> 00:07:55.600
It sounds to me like you turn into Greninja.

153
00:07:55.666 --> 00:07:56.600
Huh?

154
00:07:57.733 --> 00:07:59.266
I become Greninja?

155
00:07:59.466 --> 00:08:00.633
Pika, pika.

156
00:08:02.133 --> 00:08:04.166
That would be kind of cool if it was true.

157
00:08:05.800 --> 00:08:07.533
What's that nonsense about?

158
00:08:07.766 --> 00:08:09.800
The twerp becoming Greninja?

159
00:08:09.866 --> 00:08:11.433
What a wacky idea.

160
00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:12.733
Wobbu, wobbu.

161
00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:16.800
- That's quite the theory you've got.
- That would be so cool.

162
00:08:16.866 --> 00:08:18.333
It sure would explain a lot.

163
00:08:18.766 --> 00:08:21.766
They say when the bond between trainer and Pokémon gets stronger,

164
00:08:21.833 --> 00:08:23.000
they start to look alike.

165
00:08:23.066 --> 00:08:25.866
So, maybe that might explain whatever's happening to them,

166
00:08:25.933 --> 00:08:29.333
since the bond between Ash and Greninja has gotten so powerful.

167
00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.100
It's our bond?

168
00:08:31.833 --> 00:08:33.566
It turns me into Greninja?

169
00:08:37.366 --> 00:08:40.700
Alain. As the data I sent to you earlier shows,

170
00:08:40.766 --> 00:08:44.633
the Mega Evolution energy has accumulated according to plan.

171
00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:46.433
Thank you, Lysandre.

172
00:08:46.633 --> 00:08:48.100
- Also...
- What's that?

173
00:08:48.900 --> 00:08:51.400
I was wondering how Mairin and Chespin are doing.

174
00:09:00.666 --> 00:09:01.733
They're still the same.

175
00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:03.766
No change for either of them.

176
00:09:04.133 --> 00:09:05.266
I understand.

177
00:09:05.333 --> 00:09:06.166
Signing off.

178
00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:08.333
Hmm.

179
00:09:09.866 --> 00:09:11.166
I'll keep fighting.

180
00:09:11.233 --> 00:09:12.166
I must.

181
00:09:12.533 --> 00:09:17.166
Until Chespin recovers, and Mairin can smile once again.

182
00:09:23.666 --> 00:09:25.233
Ash, let's battle again soon.

183
00:09:25.666 --> 00:09:26.600
Sure, you bet.

184
00:09:26.666 --> 00:09:28.666
Goodbye, Sawyer.

185
00:09:35.033 --> 00:09:37.033
Who's that Pokémon?

186
00:09:42.033 --> 00:09:43.800
It's Honedge.

187
00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:45.200
Honedge.

188
00:09:56.900 --> 00:09:59.833
- Ready to proceed.
- All right. Let's begin.

189
00:10:00.133 --> 00:10:00.966
Understood.

190
00:10:02.833 --> 00:10:04.966
Now, all of you please behave.

191
00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:09.466
All systems are clear.

192
00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:10.966
Recording begun.

193
00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:13.366
Then let the experiment commence.

194
00:10:15.166 --> 00:10:16.166
Firing energy.

195
00:10:24.133 --> 00:10:27.400
Expansion of Mega Evolution energy confirmed.

196
00:10:27.566 --> 00:10:31.066
Z's internal transduction rate is holding steady at 50 percent.

197
00:10:31.133 --> 00:10:33.066
It's just as we calculated.

198
00:10:33.266 --> 00:10:35.300
Let's proceed to the next stage.

199
00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:36.933
Changing beam.

200
00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:39.466
Energy device position set.

201
00:10:43.166 --> 00:10:44.633
Fire beam at once.

202
00:10:45.766 --> 00:10:46.600
Firing.

203
00:11:08.666 --> 00:11:11.966
Such a remarkable reaction with only 10 Cells.

204
00:11:12.233 --> 00:11:13.933
Simply wonderful.

205
00:11:29.266 --> 00:11:30.200
Pika!

206
00:11:30.266 --> 00:11:32.133
- Ah! Pikachu.
- Pikachu!

207
00:11:35.233 --> 00:11:37.100
Rise and shine, losers.

208
00:11:37.166 --> 00:11:39.000
What are you doing here?

209
00:11:39.066 --> 00:11:41.333
We're making trouble, so get prepared.

210
00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:43.566
We'll make it double. You should be scared.

211
00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:46.066
To protect the world from devastation.

212
00:11:46.133 --> 00:11:49.033
To unite all people within our nation.

213
00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:51.466
To denounce the evils of sleeping late.

214
00:11:51.966 --> 00:11:55.000
To extend our reach and seal Pikachu's fate.

215
00:11:55.366 --> 00:11:57.133
- Jessie.
- And James.

216
00:11:57.600 --> 00:12:00.466
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light.

217
00:12:00.533 --> 00:12:03.533
Surrender now or prepare for an early-morning fight.

218
00:12:03.766 --> 00:12:05.300
Meowth, that's right.

219
00:12:05.366 --> 00:12:06.600
Wobbuffet!

220
00:12:08.800 --> 00:12:09.733
Team Rocket.

221
00:12:10.300 --> 00:12:12.233
All right, Pikachu. Thunderbolt.

222
00:12:12.300 --> 00:12:14.766
Pikachu! Pika?

223
00:12:14.833 --> 00:12:17.833
Wasting electricity isn't good for the environment.

224
00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:19.900
The early team hatches a great scheme.

225
00:12:21.566 --> 00:12:24.933
This is like taking candy from a baby or a cribful.

226
00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:26.900
Now, why not go back to sleep?

227
00:12:26.966 --> 00:12:28.866
You're only one Pikachu lighter.

228
00:12:28.933 --> 00:12:31.233
Meanwhile, we'll just head off into the sunrise.

229
00:12:31.733 --> 00:12:33.000
Time flies.

230
00:12:33.066 --> 00:12:34.233
Pikachu!

231
00:12:34.300 --> 00:12:35.333
Pikachu. No.

232
00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:41.066
You're not gonna get away with this.

233
00:12:42.666 --> 00:12:44.366
You twerps need your beauty sleep.

234
00:12:44.433 --> 00:12:45.566
And lots of it.

235
00:12:46.433 --> 00:12:48.033
- Gourgeist.
- Inkay.

236
00:12:50.100 --> 00:12:51.500
Ash, wait.

237
00:12:51.566 --> 00:12:53.900
- Inkay, Psybeam.
- Shadow Ball, too.

238
00:12:53.966 --> 00:12:54.800
Inkay.

239
00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:03.033
Are you guys okay?

240
00:13:03.466 --> 00:13:05.833
- Yeah. We're doing fine.
- Right behind you.

241
00:13:06.900 --> 00:13:09.066
Now, Gourgeist, Dark Pulse.

242
00:13:13.400 --> 00:13:14.566
Huh?

243
00:13:22.333 --> 00:13:23.566
What's cooking?

244
00:13:24.166 --> 00:13:25.133
Pika.

245
00:13:26.366 --> 00:13:27.433
A Charizard?

246
00:13:28.766 --> 00:13:29.700
Who are you?

247
00:13:29.900 --> 00:13:31.766
Keep your flames out of our fight.

248
00:13:31.833 --> 00:13:33.500
Go book another fiery flight.

249
00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:36.366
Charizard. Use Dragon Claw.

250
00:13:41.433 --> 00:13:42.333
Pika!

251
00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:44.100
Pikachu. Use Thunderbolt.

252
00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:47.033
Pika. Pikachu!

253
00:13:50.466 --> 00:13:51.900
Charizard, catch Pikachu.

254
00:13:53.333 --> 00:13:54.566
Pika!

255
00:13:55.700 --> 00:13:57.533
It was going so well.

256
00:13:57.600 --> 00:14:00.166
We thought we were taking candy from a baby.

257
00:14:00.466 --> 00:14:03.233
Yeah. But Charizard had other ideas.

258
00:14:03.366 --> 00:14:04.800
Wobbuffet.

259
00:14:04.866 --> 00:14:07.433
We're blasting off again.

260
00:14:07.733 --> 00:14:09.200
Za-bbuffet!

261
00:14:12.733 --> 00:14:13.566
- Pikachu.
- Pika, pi!

262
00:14:14.966 --> 00:14:16.500
Well done, Charizard.

263
00:14:18.233 --> 00:14:20.933
- Hey, are you two all right?
- You bet.

264
00:14:21.133 --> 00:14:22.166
Thanks to you.

265
00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:23.566
I'm impressed.

266
00:14:23.866 --> 00:14:26.900
Firing a midair Thunderbolt while falling to the ground.

267
00:14:27.333 --> 00:14:30.600
But if Charizard hadn't been there, it wouldn't have worked.

268
00:14:31.066 --> 00:14:32.633
Thanks a lot, Charizard.

269
00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:33.933
Pika, pika.

270
00:14:37.066 --> 00:14:38.300
Is that a Mega Stone?

271
00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:41.300
- That means Charizard is able to--
- Care to see?

272
00:14:41.466 --> 00:14:44.833
How about a battle between my Charizard and your Greninja?

273
00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:45.833
Huh?

274
00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:47.733
I saw you battle yesterday.

275
00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:49.566
I'd like to see more of that.

276
00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:52.066
That'd be great. Let's go for it.

277
00:14:59.300 --> 00:15:01.000
Charizard, come out.

278
00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:06.166
Greninja. I choose you.

279
00:15:07.266 --> 00:15:08.133
Gren.

280
00:15:08.533 --> 00:15:11.166
Hey, he said that he saw the battle yesterday.

281
00:15:11.366 --> 00:15:13.500
So, he saw what happened with Greninja.

282
00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:16.966
All right, I'll act as the referee.

283
00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:20.066
This will be a one-on-one Pokémon battle.

284
00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:23.966
The battle will be over when either Pokémon is unable to continue. Agreed?

285
00:15:24.033 --> 00:15:24.966
- Agreed.
- Agreed.

286
00:15:25.033 --> 00:15:26.933
All right, battle begin.

287
00:15:34.733 --> 00:15:35.800
I'll go first.

288
00:15:35.866 --> 00:15:36.966
Water Shuriken.

289
00:15:37.033 --> 00:15:39.800
Greninja!

290
00:15:39.866 --> 00:15:41.633
Use Dragon Claw.

291
00:15:45.900 --> 00:15:47.933
- It cut right through.
- Is that fair?

292
00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:48.866
Pikachu!

293
00:15:49.966 --> 00:15:51.733
You can do better than that.

294
00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:53.633
Now, Greninja, use Cut.

295
00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:56.100
Dodge it.

296
00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:01.466
Use Flamethrower.

297
00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:07.400
Ja!

298
00:16:08.233 --> 00:16:09.133
Gren.

299
00:16:10.133 --> 00:16:11.600
Come on, show it.

300
00:16:11.833 --> 00:16:14.866
All right. Now respond to my heart, Key Stone.

301
00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:18.166
Beyond Evolution.

302
00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:20.433
Mega Evolve.

303
00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:48.100
Charizard Mega Evolved.

304
00:16:48.500 --> 00:16:50.733
- Pika.
- A black Charizard.

305
00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:52.100
Wow, wow, wow!

306
00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:55.600
I've never seen that before. What power.

307
00:16:56.033 --> 00:16:57.533
Now I'm really fired up.

308
00:16:57.900 --> 00:17:00.666
- We can win this, right, Greninja?
- Gren.

309
00:17:00.733 --> 00:17:02.366
Charizard, let's go.

310
00:17:03.266 --> 00:17:04.466
Dragon Claw.

311
00:17:07.099 --> 00:17:07.933
Use Cut.

312
00:17:12.966 --> 00:17:15.333
- Double Team.
- Flamethrower.

313
00:17:23.266 --> 00:17:24.533
Use Aerial Ace.

314
00:17:25.233 --> 00:17:26.099
Ninja!

315
00:17:26.166 --> 00:17:28.099
Thunder Punch, go.

316
00:17:30.766 --> 00:17:32.166
- Ah!
- That's electric.

317
00:17:33.866 --> 00:17:34.700
Greninja.

318
00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:37.533
Grenin...

319
00:17:38.366 --> 00:17:40.933
All right. Hurry up then and show me.

320
00:17:41.366 --> 00:17:43.100
Thunder Punch, one more time.

321
00:17:43.900 --> 00:17:45.066
Water Shuriken.

322
00:17:45.466 --> 00:17:46.300
Gren?

323
00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:49.500
Ja!

324
00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:54.333
Greninja.

325
00:17:59.400 --> 00:18:01.433
Greninja. Are you okay?

326
00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:02.533
Nin.

327
00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:04.933
I think it's time to show them what we can do.

328
00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:10.133
Ja.

329
00:18:13.766 --> 00:18:16.966
Ninja!

330
00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:29.233
It seems like Mega Evolution...

331
00:18:29.566 --> 00:18:31.200
but they're not using the stones.

332
00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:32.833
Is their bond that strong?

333
00:18:32.900 --> 00:18:34.466
Use Aerial Ace.

334
00:18:34.533 --> 00:18:36.400
Greninja!

335
00:18:37.200 --> 00:18:38.766
All right, into the air.

336
00:18:39.766 --> 00:18:42.833
Greninja!

337
00:18:43.633 --> 00:18:44.966
Thunder Punch, let's go.

338
00:18:45.033 --> 00:18:46.200
All right, Cut.

339
00:18:49.266 --> 00:18:50.733
Gren. Nin...

340
00:18:59.866 --> 00:19:01.000
Blast Burn.

341
00:19:06.800 --> 00:19:08.100
Ja!

342
00:19:14.133 --> 00:19:15.833
Greninja is unable to battle.

343
00:19:16.033 --> 00:19:17.366
Charizard's the winner.

344
00:19:20.133 --> 00:19:21.800
Wow.

345
00:19:26.200 --> 00:19:27.233
Excellent work.

346
00:19:28.766 --> 00:19:29.766
Hmm?

347
00:19:31.533 --> 00:19:33.233
Greninja, you okay?

348
00:19:33.666 --> 00:19:34.533
Gren.

349
00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:36.400
Yeah. Me, too.

350
00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:39.566
- Let's have a battle again soon.
- Right.

351
00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:41.533
We'll work harder than ever.

352
00:19:41.600 --> 00:19:43.833
And we'll end up getting even stronger.

353
00:19:44.133 --> 00:19:45.066
Right, Greninja?

354
00:19:45.800 --> 00:19:46.800
Ninja.

355
00:19:48.633 --> 00:19:50.266
Hi. My name's Ash.

356
00:19:50.733 --> 00:19:51.566
What's yours?

357
00:19:52.466 --> 00:19:53.666
I'm Alain.

358
00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:55.466
Great battle.

359
00:19:56.233 --> 00:19:57.866
- It sure was.
- Right.

360
00:20:04.900 --> 00:20:07.733
About Greninja, how do we make that happen?

361
00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:09.466
Pika.

362
00:20:09.900 --> 00:20:11.566
We need to do some analysis.

363
00:20:11.633 --> 00:20:13.766
We can use the power of science to do that.

364
00:20:14.466 --> 00:20:16.866
That'd be great. Thanks a lot, Clemont.

365
00:20:18.200 --> 00:20:21.300
The first meeting between Ash and Alain is now history.

366
00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:22.866
At this point,

367
00:20:22.933 --> 00:20:26.633
no one has any idea how important this moment is

368
00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:28.866
for the future of the Kalos region.

369
00:20:32.933 --> 00:20:34.066
Lysandre?

370
00:20:34.133 --> 00:20:36.900
Our experiment was a great success.

371
00:20:40.233 --> 00:20:42.433
As the journey continues.
